commit d083bef0a1912d0e75c146de84d388d86e7b36f4
Author: R. Timothy Edwards <tim@opencircuitdesign.com>
Date:   Sun Oct 25 15:22:43 2026 -0400

    Fix to the handling of instance names (CellUse record cu_id) in
    a number of contexts.  Some routines had assumed an unlimited
    length to this record, while others had assumed it to be limited
    to 1024 characters (or less) and proceeded to write into a similar
    sized fixed string without checking the length.  Claude Opus 5.5
    carefully worked through the several routines that process the
    cu_id record and resolved all the issues with potential string
    overflow, and I have reviewed the resulting code.  This fix
    resolves github issue #564 (while leaving unaddressed the issue
    of why any tool would produce an instance name that is thousands
    of characters in length).
    
    Signed-off-by: R. Timothy Edwards <tim@opencircuitdesign.com>

